.TH rayscan-scripts-list 1  "list " 
.SH NAME
rayscan\-scripts\-list \- List and validate script plugin manifests
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlist\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIPATH\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List and validate script plugin manifests
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit machine\-readable JSON
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIPATH\fR]
Script manifest file or directory of *.toml manifests. Defaults to the local script library
